/Alt (Scatter plot comparing Median Track A AP \(y-axis\) to mean runtime per Track A unit on a logarithmic scale \(x-axis\), with bubble size representing unreliability percentage. Data points represent various methods, colored by method role: supervised ceiling \(green\), exploratory \(purple\), naive baseline \(yellow\), floor \(light blue\), and published \(blue\). Legend clarifies method roles and unreliability levels. hvg_logreg achieves the highest accuracy and low unreliability; CaSee shows high accuracy but more unreliability; most published methods cluster at lower accuracy and variable runtimes.)
